    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d50-a1">

                <pb facs="0081" n="47" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg47"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 57.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Moraes to
                        Mr. Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName type="venue"><hi
                                rendition="#small-caps">Presidential Palace of the
                            Republic</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-11-10"><hi rendition="#italic">November 10,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Greatly obliged. I thank your excellency for the congratulations sent me upon my
                    providential escape, and for the expressions of sorrow on account of the heroic
                    death of the minister of war.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Prudente Moraes.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
